# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Dataset media — ~15 GB of video across 3,207 files. Never committed.
# The label CSVs (748 KB total) ARE tracked: they are the ground truth and
# make the repo reproducible without the media.
# Re-download the pack from the Drive mirrors in .context/01-dataset.md
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
*.mp4
*.avi
*.mov
*.mkv
*.webm
*.m4v
dataset/**/videos/

# Derived media — synthetic long videos (plans/step-02), extracted frames, clips
synth/
frames/
clips/
*.frames/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Model artifacts — checkpoints, adapters, exports
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
checkpoints/
adapters/
output/
runs/
wandb/
*.safetensors
*.bin
*.pt
*.pth
*.ckpt
*.gguf
*.onnx

# Large intermediates. .context/artifacts/videometa.tsv is deliberately tracked
# (492 KB of measured metadata) — force-add it if a rule here ever catches it.
*.parquet
*.npy
*.npz
*.tfrecord

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Secrets — this repo is a graded, host-accessible deliverable. Keep it clean.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.pem
*.key
credentials.json
service-account*.json
secrets/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
